{\pard\plain\intbl\s4\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li197\ri190\qc\sl240\slmult1\f1\fs22\b0 12.998,00\cell}\row\pard\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb5\f2\fs25\b1\i0\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li102\fi1132\ri120\qj\sl276\slmult1\f2\fs22\b1 O MUNIC\'CDPIO DE \'C1GUA BOA\f1\b0 , Estado de Mato Grosso, pessoa jur\'EDdica de direito p\'FAblico interno, com sede administrativa \'E0 Avenida Planalto, n\'B0. 410, Centro, CEP 78.635-000, devidamente\expnd-2\expndtw-9  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 inscrito\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 no\expnd-2\expndtw-11  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 Cadastro\expnd-2\expndtw-8  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 Nacional\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 de\expnd-2\expndtw-8  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 Pessoa\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 Jur\'EDdica\expnd-2\expndtw-8  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 do\expnd-2\expndtw-11  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 Minist\'E9rio\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 da\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 Fazenda\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 -\expnd-1\expndtw-7  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 CNPJ sob o n\'B0. 15.023.898/0001-90; representado pelo Prefeito Municipal Senhor \f2\fs22\b1\i0 Mariano Kolankiewicz Filho\f1\b0 , brasileiro, casado, m\'E9dico, portador da c\'E9dula de identidade n\'BA. 2798934- 8 SSP/MT e do CPF n\'BA. 928.476.760-15, residente e domiciliado a Rua 9, n\'BA 855, Centro, na cidade de \'C1gua Boa/MT, por interm\'E9dio da Agente de Contrata\'E7\'E3o, designada pela Portaria de Municipal\expnd-3\expndtw-15  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 n\'BA.\expnd-3\expndtw-14  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 092/2024;\expnd-3\expndtw-15  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 faz\expnd-3\expndtw-15  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 saber\expnd-3\expndtw-16  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 que\expnd-3\expndtw-16  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 necessita\expnd-3\expndtw-17  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 efetuar\expnd-3\expndtw-16  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 a\expnd-3\expndtw-14  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 aquisi\'E7\'E3o\expnd-3\expndtw-14  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 de\expnd-3\expndtw-17  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 licen\'E7a\expnd-3\expndtw-15  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 de\expnd-3\expndtw-14  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 uso\expnd-3\expndtw-17  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 de\expnd-4\expndtw-18  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 software para o setor de comunica\'E7\'E3o/marketing do munic\'EDpio de \'C1gua\expnd-2\expndtw-10  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 Boa/MT.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb3\f1\fs25\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li102\fi1132\ri122\qj\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22\b0 A presente contrata\'E7\'E3o direta tem por objeto a aquisi\'E7\'E3o de licen\'E7as de uso do software \f3\fs22\b0\i1 Adobe Creative Cloud Pro for Teams (All Apps), \f1\fs22\b0\i0 modalidade VIP Governo, destinadas ao Setor de Comunica\'E7\'E3o e Marketing do Munic\'EDpio de \'C1gua Boa/MT, revelando-se medida indispens\'E1vel para assegurar a continuidade, moderniza\'E7\'E3o e efici\'EAncia das atividades institucionais de comunica\'E7\'E3o p\'FAblica desenvolvidas pela Administra\'E7\'E3o Municipal.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb4\f1\fs25\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li102\fi1132\ri123\qj\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22\b0 A contrata\'E7\'E3o encontra respaldo jur\'EDdico no artigo 75, inciso II, da Lei Federal n\'BA 14.133/2021, o qual disp\'F5e que \'93\'E9 dispens\'E1vel a licita\'E7\'E3o para contrata\'E7\'E3o que envolva valores inferiores a R$ 65.492,11 (sessenta e cinco mil quatrocentos e noventa e dois reais e onze centavos), no caso de outros servi\'E7os e compras\'94 (BRASIL, 2021). No presente caso, o valor total estimado da contrata\'E7\'E3o corresponde a R$ 12.998,00 (doze mil novecentos e noventa e oito reais), permanecendo substancialmente abaixo do limite legal vigente, circunst\'E2ncia que autoriza a ado\'E7\'E3o do procedimento de dispensa de licita\'E7\'E3o.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb4\f1\fs25\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li102\fi1132\ri120\qj\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22\b0 Todavia, a possibilidade legal de contrata\'E7\'E3o direta n\'E3o afasta a observ\'E2ncia dos princ\'EDpios\expnd-3\expndtw-15  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 constitucionais\expnd-3\expndtw-17  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 e\expnd-3\expndtw-14  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 administrativos\expnd-3\expndtw-14  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 aplic\'E1veis\expnd-3\expndtw-14  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 \'E0s\expnd-3\expndtw-14  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 contrata\'E7\'F5es\expnd-3\expndtw-17  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 p\'FAblicas.\expnd-3\expndtw-14  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 Conforme\expnd-3\expndtw-17  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 disp\'F5e o artigo 37 da Constitui\'E7\'E3o Federal, a Administra\'E7\'E3o P\'FAblica deve observar os princ\'EDpios da legalidade,\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 impessoalidade,\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 moralidade,\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 publicidade\expnd-1\expndtw-7  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 e\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 efici\'EAncia\expnd-1\expndtw-7  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 (BRASIL,\expnd-2\expndtw-10  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 1988).\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 Nesse\expnd-2\expndtw-9  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 mesmo\par\sect\sectd\sbkpage\headery361\footery1002\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb3\f1\fs17\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li102\ri128\qj\sl276\slmult1\sb94\f1\fs22\b0 sentido, a Lei n\'BA 14.133/2021 estabelece que as contrata\'E7\'F5es p\'FAblicas devem observar, entre outros, os princ\'EDpios do planejamento, da transpar\'EAncia, da motiva\'E7\'E3o, da economicidade, da segrega\'E7\'E3o de fun\'E7\'F5es e da governan\'E7a p\'FAblica (BRASIL, 2021).\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb4\f1\fs25\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li102\fi1132\ri122\qj\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22\b0 A presente contrata\'E7\'E3o foi precedida de adequado planejamento administrativo, contendo Estudo T\'E9cnico Preliminar, Termo de Refer\'EAncia, justificativa t\'E9cnica da pesquisa de pre\'E7os, demonstra\'E7\'E3o da compatibilidade or\'E7ament\'E1ria e demais documentos exigidos pelo artigo 72 da Lei n\'BA 14.133/2021, o qual determina que o processo de contrata\'E7\'E3o direta dever\'E1 ser\expnd-3\expndtw-14  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 instru\'EDdo\expnd-3\expndtw-15  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 com\expnd-3\expndtw-13  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 elementos\expnd-3\expndtw-15  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 capazes\expnd-3\expndtw-14  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 de\expnd-4\expndtw-18  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 demonstrar\expnd-3\expndtw-13  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 a\expnd-3\expndtw-15  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 necessidade\expnd-3\expndtw-14  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 da\expnd-3\expndtw-15  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 contrata\'E7\'E3o,\expnd-3\expndtw-13  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 a\expnd-3\expndtw-15  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 adequa\'E7\'E3o da solu\'E7\'E3o escolhida e a compatibilidade do pre\'E7o contratado com os valores praticados no mercado (BRASIL,\expnd0\expndtw-1  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 2021).\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb4\f1\fs25\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li102\fi1132\ri120\qj\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22\b0 Sob o aspecto t\'E9cnico, a aquisi\'E7\'E3o das licen\'E7as da \f3\fs22\b0\i1 Adobe Creative Cloud \f1\fs22\b0\i0 mostra-se imprescind\'EDvel para garantir condi\'E7\'F5es adequadas de funcionamento ao Setor de Comunica\'E7\'E3o e Marketing, respons\'E1vel pelas produ\'E7\'F5es de conte\'FAdos institucionais, campanhas educativas, pe\'E7as publicit\'E1rias, v\'EDdeos informativos, materiais gr\'E1ficos, identidade visual e divulga\'E7\'E3o das a\'E7\'F5es governamentais junto \'E0 popula\'E7\'E3o. A comunica\'E7\'E3o institucional moderna exige elevado padr\'E3o t\'E9cnico e visual, sobretudo em raz\'E3o da crescente utiliza\'E7\'E3o de plataformas digitais, redes sociais e mecanismos de transpar\'EAncia ativa, os quais demandam produ\'E7\'E3o cont\'EDnua de materiais gr\'E1ficos e audiovisuais de qualidade profissional.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb4\f1\fs25\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li102\fi1132\ri124\qj\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22\b0 A solu\'E7\'E3o escolhida atende integralmente \'E0s necessidades operacionais da Administra\'E7\'E3o, considerando que a su\'EDte \f3\fs22\b0\i1 Adobe Creative Cloud \f1\fs22\b0\i0 constitui refer\'EAncia consolidada no mercado de design gr\'E1fico, edi\'E7\'E3o de imagem, produ\'E7\'E3o audiovisual, diagrama\'E7\'E3o e tratamento de documentos digitais. Os softwares integrantes do pacote, tais como \f3\fs22\b0\i1 Photoshop, \f3\fs22\b0\i1 Illustrator, Premiere Pro, After Effects, InDesign e Acrobat Pro\f1\i0 , s\'E3o amplamente utilizados por \'F3rg\'E3os\expnd-2\expndtw-12  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 p\'FAblicos,\expnd-2\expndtw-10  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 ag\'EAncias\expnd-2\expndtw-11  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 de\expnd-2\expndtw-11  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 publicidade,\expnd-2\expndtw-10  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 gr\'E1ficas\expnd-2\expndtw-11  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 e\expnd-2\expndtw-10  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 profissionais\expnd-2\expndtw-11  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 de\expnd-2\expndtw-12  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 comunica\'E7\'E3o,\expnd-2\expndtw-9  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 assegurando compatibilidade t\'E9cnica, interoperabilidade e padroniza\'E7\'E3o dos arquivos\expnd-2\expndtw-9  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 institucionais.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb2\f1\fs25\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li102\fi1132\ri124\qj\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22\b0 A contrata\'E7\'E3o da modalidade \'93\f3\i1 Pro for Teams\f1\i0 \'94 revela-se tecnicamente necess\'E1ria, uma vez que oferece mecanismos de gest\'E3o centralizada das licen\'E7as por meio do Admin Console, permitindo \'E0 Administra\'E7\'E3o realizar controle dos usu\'E1rios, redistribui\'E7\'E3o de acessos, gerenciamento de permiss\'F5es e acompanhamento da utiliza\'E7\'E3o dos ativos digitais. Tal funcionalidade encontra conson\'E2ncia com os princ\'EDpios da efici\'EAncia administrativa e da governan\'E7a p\'FAblica previstos na Lei n\'BA 14.133/2021 (BRASIL, 2021).\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb5\f1\fs25\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li102\fi1132\ri123\qj\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22\b0 Al\'E9m disso, a solu\'E7\'E3o contempla armazenamento em nuvem, compartilhamento de bibliotecas institucionais, sincroniza\'E7\'E3o de projetos e ferramentas de intelig\'EAncia artificial generativa, recursos que contribuem para a otimiza\'E7\'E3o do fluxo de trabalho, redu\'E7\'E3o do tempo de produ\'E7\'E3o de materiais institucionais e padroniza\'E7\'E3o da identidade visual da Administra\'E7\'E3o P\'FAblica Municipal.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb3\f1\fs25\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li102\fi1132\ri122\qj\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22\b0 A contrata\'E7\'E3o tamb\'E9m se justifica sob a \'F3tica da legalidade e da seguran\'E7a da informa\'E7\'E3o, tendo em vista que assegura a utiliza\'E7\'E3o de softwares originais e devidamente licenciados. A utiliza\'E7\'E3o de softwares sem licenciamento regular exp\'F5e a Administra\'E7\'E3o P\'FAblica a riscos jur\'EDdicos, operacionais e cibern\'E9ticos, podendo comprometer a integridade das\par\sect\sectd\sbkpage\headery361\footery1002
