\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl14\slmult1\fs20\par}\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb3\f1\fs17\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li102\ri125\qj\sl276\slmult1\sb94\f1\fs22\b0 informa\'E7\'F5es institucionais, a seguran\'E7a dos dados p\'FAblicos e a continuidade dos servi\'E7os administrativos. Nesse contexto, a regulariza\'E7\'E3o do ambiente tecnol\'F3gico municipal constitui medida necess\'E1ria \'E0 prote\'E7\'E3o do patrim\'F4nio p\'FAblico digital e \'E0 observ\'E2ncia da legisla\'E7\'E3o de propriedade intelectual.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb3\f1\fs25\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li102\fi1132\ri120\qj\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22\b0 No\expnd-2\expndtw-9  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 tocante\expnd-2\expndtw-8  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 \'E0\expnd-2\expndtw-10  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 vantajosidade\expnd-2\expndtw-8  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 econ\'F4mica,\expnd-1\expndtw-7  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 a\expnd-2\expndtw-11  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 Administra\'E7\'E3o\expnd-2\expndtw-10  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 realizou\expnd-2\expndtw-8  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 pesquisa\expnd-3\expndtw-13  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 de\expnd-2\expndtw-8  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 pre\'E7os em conformidade com o artigo 23 da Lei n\'BA 14.133/2021, mediante consultas ao mercado especializado e an\'E1lise de contrata\'E7\'F5es p\'FAblicas similares. A metodologia adotada observou crit\'E9rios t\'E9cnicos de balizamento, cesta de pre\'E7os e compara\'E7\'E3o mercadol\'F3gica, demonstrando que a proposta apresentada pela empresa TECNETWORKING SERVI\'C7OS E SOLU\'C7\'D5ES EM TI LTDA apresenta compatibilidade com os pre\'E7os praticados no mercado, revelando-se economicamente vantajosa para a Administra\'E7\'E3o\expnd-2\expndtw-9  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 P\'FAblica.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb5\f1\fs25\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li102\fi1132\ri125\qj\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22\b0 A justificativa t\'E9cnica da pesquisa de pre\'E7os tamb\'E9m demonstrou a limita\'E7\'E3o competitiva natural existente no segmento de licenciamento corporativo de softwares especializados, especialmente na modalidade VIP Governo, circunst\'E2ncia que restringe o n\'FAmero\expnd-3\expndtw-15  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 de\expnd-3\expndtw-15  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 fornecedores\expnd-4\expndtw-18  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 aptos\expnd-2\expndtw-12  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 a\expnd-3\expndtw-15  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 comercializar\expnd-3\expndtw-14  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 o\expnd-3\expndtw-13  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 objeto\expnd-3\expndtw-14  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 pretendido.\expnd-3\expndtw-14  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 Ainda\expnd-2\expndtw-12  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 assim,\expnd-3\expndtw-14  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 a\expnd-2\expndtw-12  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 Administra\'E7\'E3o promoveu\expnd-2\expndtw-11  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 dilig\'EAncias\expnd-2\expndtw-8  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 suficientes\expnd-2\expndtw-8  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 para\expnd-2\expndtw-11  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 obten\'E7\'E3o\expnd-2\expndtw-11  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 de\expnd-2\expndtw-11  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 propostas\expnd-2\expndtw-10  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 e\expnd-3\expndtw-14  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 forma\'E7\'E3o\expnd-2\expndtw-10  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 de\expnd-2\expndtw-8  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 pre\'E7o\expnd-2\expndtw-10  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 de\expnd-2\expndtw-12  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 refer\'EAncia, observando os princ\'EDpios da razoabilidade, economicidade e busca da proposta mais\expnd-7\expndtw-33  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 vantajosa.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb2\f1\fs25\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li102\fi1132\ri125\qj\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22\b0 Cumpre destacar que a contrata\'E7\'E3o encontra-se devidamente prevista no Plano de Contrata\'E7\'F5es Anual do exerc\'EDcio de 2026, demonstrando alinhamento com o planejamento estrat\'E9gico\expnd-2\expndtw-9  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 municipal\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 e\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 com\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 as\expnd-2\expndtw-8  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 a\'E7\'F5es\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 voltadas\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 \'E0\expnd-2\expndtw-10  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 moderniza\'E7\'E3o\expnd-2\expndtw-8  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 administrativa,\expnd-1\expndtw-7  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 fortalecimento\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 da transpar\'EAncia p\'FAblica e aprimoramento da comunica\'E7\'E3o\expnd-2\expndtw-10  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 institucional.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb6\f1\fs25\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li102\fi1132\ri122\qj\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22\b0 Ademais, a solu\'E7\'E3o adotada observa crit\'E9rios de sustentabilidade administrativa e ambiental, considerando que a entrega do objeto ocorrer\'E1 integralmente em formato digital, eliminando\expnd-3\expndtw-14  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 a\expnd-3\expndtw-13  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 necessidade\expnd-3\expndtw-13  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 de\expnd-3\expndtw-16  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 materiais\expnd-3\expndtw-16  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 f\'EDsicos,\expnd-2\expndtw-12  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 embalagens\expnd-3\expndtw-13  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 ou\expnd-3\expndtw-16  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 res\'EDduos\expnd-3\expndtw-13  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 s\'F3lidos,\expnd-2\expndtw-12  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 em\expnd-3\expndtw-13  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 conson\'E2ncia com as diretrizes de desmaterializa\'E7\'E3o e sustentabilidade previstas na nova Lei de Licita\'E7\'F5es e Contratos Administrativos.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb3\f1\fs25\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li102\fi1132\ri122\qj\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22\b0 Dessa forma, resta demonstrado que a presente contrata\'E7\'E3o direta por dispensa de licita\'E7\'E3o encontra amparo legal no artigo 75, inciso II, da Lei Federal n\'BA 14.133/2021, apresentando-se\expnd-2\expndtw-9  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 t\'E9cnica,\expnd-1\expndtw-7  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 jur\'EDdica\expnd-2\expndtw-9  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 e\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 administrativamente\expnd-2\expndtw-8  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 necess\'E1ria,\expnd-1\expndtw-7  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 proporcional\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 e\expnd-2\expndtw-9  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 vantajosa\expnd-2\expndtw-8  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 ao interesse p\'FAblico, assegurando ao Munic\'EDpio de \'C1gua Boa/MT condi\'E7\'F5es adequadas para o desempenho\expnd-3\expndtw-15  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 eficiente,\expnd-3\expndtw-16  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 moderno\expnd-3\expndtw-15  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 e\expnd-3\expndtw-15  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 transparente\expnd-3\expndtw-14  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 de\expnd-4\expndtw-18  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 suas\expnd-3\expndtw-15  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 atividades\expnd-3\expndtw-15  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 institucionais\expnd-3\expndtw-15  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 de\expnd-3\expndtw-14  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 comunica\'E7\'E3o e\expnd0\expndtw-1  \f1\fs22\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0 marketing.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocw